[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=24 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="第一次开旁通，水是棕色的。有人刚把杯子递过来，拉姆森就把阀门关小，让所有人别喝。她拿起透明瓶接了一点，放在阳光里慢慢看沉淀。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="要等它自己变清？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="先冲管。哪怕最后会变清，也不能让第一桶进人家的壶。你们想拿来洗甲板都得看里面有没有别的东西。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="一个男孩说自家杯子本来就看不清水色，拉姆森便换了只白碗，告诉他可以先用这个看。你发现“公开数据”不是把仪表挂出来就结束，还得有人能看懂它。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="现在测到的是出口，管到另一边会不会又变？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="会。你这句问得好。我们得看最远的取水点，不只盯修得最方便的地方。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="我带两个人去末端。帕金斯留在这里记变化，指挥官，你来对时。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们约定每次开阀都先报秒数，另一端确认听见再动。风里有时候会丢半句，你们就重说，不拿心照不宣来省一次确认。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="这边开始了。先小开，按刚才那道刻线。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="远端"

speaker_name=""

text="收到，小开。先不接饮用桶。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="水绕过几个旧弯头，终于在最远端流出来。无线电里传来压低的欢呼，随后弗莱彻又报来一次确认：水色清了，流量不稳，还不能交接。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="她连高兴都得分成两步。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="至少这次第二步有人在看。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="第三次测试，靠里的接头开始漏。你听见漏声时已经想开口，拉姆森先说报位置，她不在那个角度。你把看见的形状说清楚，没有照着记忆里学过的词乱报部件名。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="好了，停这里。今天主回路就算恢复，也不用它撑全部负荷。留这条路，明天有人来换密封。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="不把它一次修完吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="人会累，光也快没了。现在看得清楚的地方都试过，再往里拆是另一份工作。写交接，不能因为舍不得收工，就把新的风险塞进去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们给阀门加上临时标记，旁边写明不是永久刻度。德雷顿拿布擦掉旧的“正常”两个字，换成“当前限流，明早复查”。有人嫌字多，她就把最要紧的一项画成大箭头。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="还差维护班通过外环的路线。平台停下以后，海面不代表就安全。我们得实际走一遍，才敢告诉明天的人从哪里来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="这趟只检查通路，不追零散目标。确认全队都能过，回来交接，别把一项收尾变成另一次远征。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_20"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把末端取水点的位置也加到航路旁边。今天带回去的不会只有一份战果，还有一条有人真的试过、明天能够继续用的路。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

